level_3_description = "+12 STR, +21 health, +10 DEX. 2 card slots. On-self: playing a slotted card puts a copy of Close is Favored into your hand, up to 3 held at once (Instant: an enemy entering melee range takes 13 damage; erased). When an ally deals damage within 3 squares of you, you take 10% of it as well. Grants Balistic Arrow: 30 damage — hitting an enemy does not stop this arrow (75 mana, 5 tempo)."
